From 9af84909d26fc049ecac7bc6097af1f3d3cc6740 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chris <chris_bass_player@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 22:38:48 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Add Squad Strike (1v1 tag team) for offline and LAN/Direct
 netplay

Port of the Squad Strike v4.0.1 Gecko codes. Each player builds a squad of
up to four fighters on character select (Z adds, Z on your coin pick
removes, Z on a member recolours); one stock each, the next fighter drops in
on the revival platform.

Instead of v4's mid-match streaming, the AllM/AllA heaps are 4x, ARAM is
64 MB and the sound allowance 2x, so every member is preloaded and its
archives parsed during match setup. A swap never touches the disc and is
plain snapshotted game state, so rollback netplay stays deterministic.
Unranked and Ranked are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LGEra9KPAZ22ueoBzgh3ww
